      <div class="spec-note"><h4>Money-flow zoom</h4><p>Two bars on two different scales would mislead if they simply sat next to each other. The trapezoid shows that the lower bar is one slice of the upper bar, enlarged. Slices too small to see still get a sliver of 0.8% so they can be followed.</p></div></article>
  </div>

  <div class="block-title"><h3>Under the floor</h3><span class="label">How it works</span></div>
  <div class="eng">
    <div class="eng-diagram"><div class="dg">
