        <div class="dg-lane"><div class="nd src"><b>Print provider</b><small>print-on-demand API</small></div><i class="w d2"></i><div class="nd"><b>Cost planner</b><small>pure function, no IO</small></div><i class="w d2"></i><div class="nd"><b>Match</b><small>by order number</small></div></div>
